---
import { portfolioData } from '@/data/portfolio';
import Icon from './Icon.astro'; const { education, certifications } = portfolioData;
--- <section id="sobre" class="section relative bg-neutral-950" aria-labelledby="about-title"> <div class="container-custom relative z-10"> <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 lg:mb-20 text-center"> <p data-reveal class="eyebrow mb-5 mx-auto">Perfil</p> <h2 id="about-title" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms" class="section-title mb-4">Sobre Mim</h2> <p data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 140ms" class="section-subtitle mx-auto">Conheça minha trajetória, formação e o que me move como desenvolvedor.</p> </header> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6"> <article data-reveal class="card"> <div class="flex items-start gap-4"> <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/[0.05] dark:bg-neutral-50/[0.07] border border-neutral-900/[0.06] dark:border-neutral-50/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"> <Icon name="code" class="w-6 h-6 text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50" /> </div> <div> <h3 class="text-clamp-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50 mb-3">Formação Acadêmica</h3> <div class="space-y-2"> <p class="text-clamp-base text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed"> <strong class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">{education.degree}, {education.institution} </p> <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">{education.period}</p> <p class="text-clamp-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2">{education.details}</p> </div> </div> </div> </article> <article data-reveal class="card"> <div class="flex items-start gap-4"> <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/[0.05] dark:bg-neutral-50/[0.07] border border-neutral-900/[0.06] dark:border-neutral-50/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"> <Icon name="server" class="w-6 h-6 text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50" /> </div> <div> <h3 class="text-clamp-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50 mb-3">Objetivo Profissional</h3> <p class="text-clamp-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed"> Busco atuar nas áreas de desenvolvimento de software (Backend/Fullstack), testes de software (QA) ou análise de dados. Possuo experiência prática com Python, PHP e JavaScript, com raciocínio lógico e atenção a detalhes aplicados na especificação e validação de funcionalidades. Tenho vivência em ambiente de pesquisa e extensão universitária, e busco uma oportunidade para aplicar e expandir meus conhecimentos técnicos, integrar times ágeis e evoluir profissionalmente. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article data-reveal class="card"> <div class="flex items-start gap-4"> <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-900/[0.05] dark:bg-neutral-50/[0.07] border border-neutral-900/[0.06] dark:border-neutral-50/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"> <Icon name="check" class="w-6 h-6 text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50" /> </div> <div> <h3 class="text-clamp-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50 mb-4">Cursos e Certificações</h3> <div class="space-y-3"> {certifications.map((cert, i) => ( <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-800/50 border border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-200 dark:hover:border-neutral-700"> <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center"> <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400" /> </span> <div> <p class="font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50 text-sm">{cert.name}</p> <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">{cert.issuer} • {cert.date}</p> </div> </div> ))} </div> </div> </div> </article> </div>
</section>